          {" "}
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/covid-19-sentiment-analysis-rajarshi-chattopadhyay/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Write-up</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/writing/risc-fpga/">A 16-bit RISC processor on an FPGA</a>
          {" "}â€” first runner-up, IETE Technical Paper Contest, 2014.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <p class="contact-note">
      <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
    </p>
  </main>
</Base>
